      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "2005 Wiley-Liss, Inc.",
        "AbstractText": "We report a case with a large aneurysm of the proximal left anterior descending coronary artery involving the bifurcation with a diagonal branch. We used a custom-made bifurcation system with a polytetrafluoroethylene-covered stent for the main branch and a bare metal stent for the side branch with excellent clinical and angiographic result at 5-month follow-up."
